{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/","folio-assistant-sci":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant-sci/v0/ns/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-local-q-zeta-function","@type":["folio-assistant-sci:Definition","doco:Section"],"label":"def:local-q-zeta-function","kind":"definition","title":"Local $q$-zeta function of Bring's curve","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-brings-coordinate-ring","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-substrate-parameter-planck"],"tags":["zeta-function","local","brings-curve","characteristic-polynomial","frobenius-endomorphism"],"defines":["local-q-zeta-function"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.AlgebraicSubstrate.LocalQZetaFunction","text":"local-q-zeta-function.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"def:local-q-zeta-function\"></a><p>The <dfn class=\"defterm\" id=\"term-local-q-zeta-function\">local <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-zeta function</dfn> of Bring's curve <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{B}</code> is\nthe generating function for point counts over finite extensions:</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">Z(\\mathcal{B}, t) = \\exp\\!\\left(\\sum_{n=1}^{\\infty} \\frac{|\\mathcal{B}(\\mathbb{F}_{q^n})|}{n} t^n\\right) = \\frac{P(t)}{(1-t)(1-qt)},</code></pre>\n<p>where <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">P(t) = \\prod_{i=1}^{2g}(1 - \\alpha_i t)</code> is the characteristic polynomial of the Frobenius endomorphism <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathrm{Fr}_q : H^1(\\mathcal{B}) \\to H^1(\\mathcal{B})</code>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/q-geometric-langlands/local-q-zeta-function.md","heading":"Definition","number":"24.8.1","page":"b/def-local-q-zeta-function","qa":{"counts":{"pass":79,"fail":1,"warn":1,"na":11,"unknown":0,"stale":66},"milnor":{"total":3,"notPassing":0}},"lean":{"expected":true,"ref":"qou:QOU.BringsSurface.LocalQZetaFunction","via":"ref","path":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BringsSurface/LocalQZetaFunction.lean","compiles":"unchecked","sorry":false,"sorryBasis":"text"}}
